// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// jiaotu.c 五毒教徒
// by victori
inherit NPC;

void create()
{
	set_name("五毒教徒", ({"jiao tu","tu"}));
	set("long",
		"一个五毒的基层教徒，看来刚入教不久。\n"	);

	set("gender", "男性");
	set("attitude", "friendly");

	set("age", 25);
	set("shen_type", -1);
	set("str", 20);
	set("int", 30);
	set("con", 25);
	set("dex", 23);
	set("max_qi", 500);
	set("max_jing", 500);
	set("neili", 380);
	set("max_neili", 380);
	set("jiali", 20);
	set("combat_exp", 83000);
	set("chat_chance", 30);

	set_skill("force", 90);
	set_skill("unarmed", 90);
	set_skill("dodge", 90);
	set_skill("parry", 90);

	setup();
	carry_object("/d/city/obj/cloth")->wear();

	setup();
}

